  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor 1999-2016 Ford F-250 F250 Super Duty 8 ft\nfor 1999-2016 Ford F-350 F350 Super Duty 8 ft\nFeatures\nGreat Fit:\nReliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to\nensure precise compatibility with the 8'/96.0in bed of 1999-2016 Ford\nF-250/F-350/ F250/F350 Super Duty.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of\nthe side rails keep the cover close tightly; sturdy clamps and buckles\nwith straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your\ntruck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.",
